This project reimplements and builds on StochasticAgingClock
(https://github.com/Meyer-DH/StochasticAgingClock, commit caf31fd37fc4ce67016229ae1dc1e985ef9e4745),
the code accompanying Meyer D.H. & Schumacher B., "Aging clocks based on accumulating stochastic
variation", Nature Aging 4, 871-885 (2024), doi:10.1038/s43587-024-00619-x.
Its data files are downloaded at run time (`entropy-age fetch upstream`) and are not redistributed
in this repository. The upstream licence applies to the ported algorithms and to those data files:

